        "text": "optional alertKeywords on every column, yellow ring on matched rows + Bell badge in header. Lives as column property (sibling to title), never sent to server fetchers, so all 43 plugins get the feature with zero plugin code changes. Wide match scope (author/handle/content/url), 16-term cap, 64-char-per-term cap, 512-char input clamp. Deck export/import round-trips with backward compat.",
